
~ start

match interaction_count
	when 1
		PLUM: I can't read. (sad)
		VINCENT: There's no reason for you to read.
		PLUM: It'll be fun! (silly)
		VINCENT: What you're steeping in are the ramblings of some mad man. (happy)
		=> END

	else
		PLUM: Can I at least have a hint. (worried)
		VINCENT: No. (angry)
		=> END
